<title>POLAND: OPTIMUS APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 833,000.</title>
<headline>OPTIMUS APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 833,000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.83 vs   0.87</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.82 vs   1.53</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.52 vs   1.42</p>
<p> Sales		   32.14 vs  26.20</p>
